+|---|---|---|---|---|
+| `U = ∅` (only released) | `R`, in order | no advance | each taken (CAS) and re-run in order | `test_a_released_claim_is_taken_and_run_at_once`, `test_taking_a_released_claim_leaves_the_epoch_alone` |
