+/**
+ * What a person writes → what `parse_size` reads, or `null` when it is not a
+ * size at all. People write "512MB", "512 mb", "1.5G" and the display format
+ * "512.0 MB" as readily as "512M"; the server reads only `<integer>[K|M|G|T]`.
